<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Wah Tung year net profit up 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Wah Tung year net profit up 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.05 vs 5.20</p>
<p>    Net					5.15 vs 4.88</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     5.10 vs 5.10</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     8.20 vs 8.80</p>
<p>    Sales				   77.60 vs 73.08</p>
<p>    Other income			    nil vs 0.02</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   14.47 vs 14.17</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked  </p>
<p>Pay date Oct 31</p>
<p>Reg date Sep 30</p>
<p>    Tax					0.55 vs 0.30</p>
<p>    Interest			credit 1.29 vs 0.96</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   0.54 vs 0.21</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.05 vs 0.02</p>
<p>NOTE: Wah Tung International Holdings Ltd is a Hong Kong-based engineering and building services company.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
